// Ammunition Consumption Rates (§50.2), full Logistics Game column. Ammo Points expended per
// TOE Strength Point performing the action (§50.14). Authoritative machine values; transcription
// in docs/source-materials/ammo-consumption.md.
//
// close_assault (rate 2) applies to Armor-class, Gun-class, MG-inf and HvyWpn-inf — not plain
// rifle infantry. Air actions are handled by the Air Game.
(
    barrage: 4,
    anti_armor: 3,
    close_assault: 2,
    anti_air: 2,
)
